                explanation: `Comme $[OC)$ est la bissectrice, $\\widehat{AOC} = \\widehat{COB} = 27°$. Donc $\\widehat{AOB} = \\widehat{AOC} + \\widehat{COB} = 27° + 27° = 54°$.`
